  "remarks": "\nFormer member of the State Duma and former First Deputy Chairman of the Committee on Relations with CIS Countries, Eurasian Integration and Relations with Compatriots of the State Duma. On 20 March 2014 he voted in favour of the draft Federal Constitutional Law ‘on the acceptance into the Russian Federation of the Republic of Crimea and the formation within the Russian Federation of new federal subjects- the republic of Crimea and the City of Federal Status Sevastopol’.  Member of the Presidium of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of the Russian Federation.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
